{"title":"Would You Like to Sign The Contract?","synopsis":"Ini demi Presdir Apa ada masalah Katakata ini kembali bagaikan pisau dan pada hari itu aku mati Lalu aku hidup kembali Dari Yunseok yang merupakan direktur dari perusahaan investasi real estate terbaik di Korea Selatan menjadi Kim Donggyu seorang penyendiri dan pecundang Setelah frustasi sesaat aku bangkit kembali untuk balas dendam Tunggu aku Aku pasti akan membuat mereka membayar atas apa yang telah mereka perbuat padaku Hari ini aku membuat rencana sebagai Yunseok dan menjalankannya sebagai Kim Donggyu Demi balas dendam kami","alternative_title":"계약하시겠습니까?","author":"Lee Junho, Sad Stone Mangu","artist":"Ji-Dong","genres":["Action","Drama","Mystery","Slice of Life"],"chapters":[{"id":"0185d94b-2964-4a14-a037-c2c1ae1bf15c","number":"43","title":"Chapter 43","date":"2024-11-25","images":[]},{"id":"7e3eed9b-2201-4d44-b741-903fcfab4970","number":"42","title":"Chapter 42","date":"2024-11-25","images":[]},{"id":"e73e69c2-a7da-4912-ab5f-dcf5ea1225dd","number":"41","title":"Chapter 41","date":"2024-11-25","images":[]},{"id":"8662b396-8375-4add-bcad-fab8a4387959","number":"40","title":"Chapter 40","date":"2024-11-25","images":[]},{"id":"d0e99e38-4be5-439e-a7fb-e458bebbe581","number":"39","title":"Chapter 39","date":"2024-11-25","images":[]},{"id":"4da03e3a-1033-403b-9411-1e4d6f3ec1b2","number":"38","title":"Chapter 38","date":"2024-11-25","images":[]},{"id":"705e5810-6c0b-419b-82ab-eb6d220cfb90","number":"37","title":"Chapter 37","date":"2024-11-25","images":[]},{"id":"7d614a41-f921-4379-be8c-25b414048284","number":"36","title":"Chapter 36","date":"2024-11-25","images":[]},{"id":"9961ce39-cc5f-44f4-9c6b-d99f349e700e","number":"35","title":"Chapter 35","date":"2024-11-25","images":[]},{"id":"6f6a2d17-8a70-4806-a0fb-aac90a8453ad","number":"34","title":"Chapter 34","date":"2024-11-25","images":[]},{"id":"6dce2d37-39ef-4d33-a703-4e4f4243dedf","number":"33","title":"Chapter 33","date":"2024-11-25","images":[]},{"id":"